{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11732-ghost-and-spirit-covers","id":11732,"title":"Ghost and Spirit Covers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-15T17:49:47-08:00","id":11732,"title":"Ghost and Spirit Covers","content":"Well since there is a power that allows for ephemeral covers, it left me with questions and comments.<br /> <br /> For one thing, spirits have choirs and ranks, how does a demon emulate those? I can't imagine many spirits willing to sell those away in pacts after all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And ghosts have identities, or former identities does that mean a demon would have to form a cover as normal for a ghost identity to pass muster?<br /> <br /> Ghosts and spirits have numina and influences, but demons don't have access to those, but if they use their embeds and exploits they might break cover. Does it seem odd to anyone else that a demon in a cover that should have innate abilities they get the godmachine in their grill for using powers their cover's should actually cover?<br /> <br /> And I don't know about anyone else, but angels are ephemerals too, so it seems to me that a demon with this power ought to be able to take angeljacking to an entirely new level. Although I imagine being a double agent against the godmachine would be a very dangerous job.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T19:34:07-08:00","id":11797,"title":"","content":"Soooooo....as an add on to this question, could you soul pact a familiar?<br /> <br /> I mean, obviously the mage who loses the familiar is going to notice something is wrong instantly, but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T08:43:23-08:00","id":12090,"title":"","content":"Also: that Exploit notes that they &quot;can Manifest like a ghost or spirit of comparable Rank&quot; but doesn't mention how the Cover's Rank is calculated. Is it just up to the creating Demon?<br /> <br /> Seems like this Exploit needs some more details. I hope it gets them, because I must say I really like the concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/877-mugasofer","name":"MugaSofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar877_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T08:56:11-08:00","id":12099,"title":"","content":"Rank should be equal to the rating in the Cover or Primum one or the other. Since you don't make pacts with spirits and ghosts so much as just tear them to pieces, I would assume either the demon can declare himself to be of any choir, or is automatically of the choir of the spirit he used for the Cover, or technically has no choir. Ghosts lose their identities over time normally, so no, I don't think a ghost Cover needs an identity beyond being a ghost. I don't think you could technically take a familiar as a Cover; it would just wind up as a regular spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T09:41:40-08:00","id":12127,"title":"","content":"Actually the question that ArcaneArts brings up leads me to another weird one: can a Cryptid with sapience make a soul pact?<br /> <br /> Could this lead to an animal Cover without needing to Angel-Jack?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T12:25:40-08:00","id":12232,"title":"","content":"I was wondering if I just missed that part that said what your rank should be. I guess for now the best thing would be half your Primum rounded up. As a general rule of thumb, any spirit above Rank 6 is to strong to be worth stating up, so it would be odd for a demon to be trying to imitate that. But then again, it would actually be useful if you could choose what Rank that particular Cover manifests, because a ghost higher then Rank 2 or any high level spiritual entity in general is going to raise some eyebrows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}